# Frontend conventions

- Keep Astro in static-output mode. Every route must emit a physical file and
  work at domain root `/` without rewrites or a runtime.
- Home, résumé, and ordinary content routes ship no client framework
  JavaScript. Preact is allowed only under `apps/site/src/features/replay/`.
- Never import `apps/runtime`, Live-Groq, server config, Node-only modules, or
  secret names into browser-reachable code.
- Treat Replay bundles as untrusted public input: schema-validate before use,
  render strings as text, and never inject raw HTML.
- Accept no arbitrary prompt, context, URL, upload, key, or visitor data.
- Factual portfolio text comes from `packages/resume` via typed CV source paths;
  do not copy or paraphrase CV strings in components.
- Implement only the Editorial Evidence Ledger in
  `docs/design-direction.md`. No alternate themes or prohibited AI-slop
  patterns.
- Use semantic HTML, native controls, skip links, visible focus, text-plus-shape
  state, keyboard-complete Replay, and reduced-motion behavior.
- The integrity result may claim only a match to the root included in the same
  bundle. Keep the same-origin limitation adjacent to the result.
- Use root-correct links and same-origin static asset URLs. Replay must remain
  useful before hydration and make no external request.
